{"title": "Detect Thoughts", "pageid": 2350, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Detect_Thoughts", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 2 Spells", "Divination spells", "Ritual spells", "Spells that can be transcribed", "Actions", "Bugs"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Detect_Thoughts.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Detect_Thoughts.webp/300px-Detect_Thoughts.webp, /w/images/5/5a/Detect_Thoughts.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5a/Detect_Thoughts.webp/300px-Detect_Thoughts.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5a/Detect_Thoughts.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Detect Thoughts </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 2 divination spell</a>. It allows spellcasters to telepathically link to unprotected minds and hear the thoughts of targeted creatures while talking to them.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nFocus your mind to read the thoughts of certain creatures while talking to them.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 2 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: Self\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: Self</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Ritual_spells\" title=\"Spells\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/25px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/38px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ritual\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png/25px-Ritual_Spell_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Ritual_Spell_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Ritual_spells\" title=\"Spells\">Ritual</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/38px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Concentration\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png/25px-Concentration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/83/Concentration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a></dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Shout_DetectThoughts</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_DetectThoughts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Shout_DetectThoughts\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsConcentration_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsConcentration (spell flag)\">IsConcentration</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Detect_Thoughts\"> Condition: Detect Thoughts </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Detect_Thoughts_(Condition)\" title=\"Detect Thoughts (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Detect Thoughts\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Detect_Thoughts_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Detect_Thoughts_(Condition)\" title=\"Detect Thoughts (Condition)\">Detect Thoughts</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The affected creature can read the thoughts of certain creatures while talking to them.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\nClasses: <ul><li> Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Bard\" title=\"Bard\">Bard</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sorcerer\" title=\"Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizard</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Great_Old_One\" title=\"The Great Old One\">The Great Old One</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_the_Spores\" title=\"Circle of the Spores\">Circle of the Spores</a> (Circle Spell)</li><li> Class level 8: <a href=\"/wiki/Arcane_Trickster\" title=\"Arcane Trickster\">Arcane Trickster</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\">Eldritch Knight</a></li></ul>\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uncovered_Mysteries\" title=\"Uncovered Mysteries\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/33/Amulet_Necklace_B_Silver_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Uncovered_Mysteries\" title=\"Uncovered Mysteries\">Uncovered Mysteries</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hammer_of_the_Just\" title=\"Hammer of the Just\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e4/Warhammer_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Hammer_of_the_Just\" title=\"Hammer of the Just\">Hammer of the Just</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Long rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Soul_Perception\" title=\"Mask of Soul Perception\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Mask_of_Soul_Perception_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mask_of_Soul_Perception_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Mask_of_Soul_Perception_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Mask_of_Soul_Perception_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/33/Mask_of_Soul_Perception_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Mask_of_Soul_Perception_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/33/Mask_of_Soul_Perception_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Mask_of_Soul_Perception_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/33/Mask_of_Soul_Perception_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mask_of_Soul_Perception\" title=\"Mask of Soul Perception\">Mask of Soul Perception</a></span> (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Short rest\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: <a href=\"/wiki/Short_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short rest\">Short rest</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Mind_Reading\" title=\"Potion of Mind Reading\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/POT_Potion_of_Mind_Reading_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Potion_of_Mind_Reading\" title=\"Potion of Mind Reading\">Potion of Mind Reading</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:<br>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wizard\" title=\"Wizard\">Wizards</a> with <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 2 Spell Slots</a> can <a href=\"/wiki/Transcribing_scrolls\" title=\"Transcribing scrolls\">transcribe</a> a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Detect_Thoughts\" title=\"Scroll of Detect Thoughts\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Scroll_of_Detect_Thoughts_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Detect_Thoughts_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Scroll_of_Detect_Thoughts_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Scroll_of_Detect_Thoughts_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Scroll_of_Detect_Thoughts_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Scroll_of_Detect_Thoughts_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Scroll_of_Detect_Thoughts_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Scroll_of_Detect_Thoughts_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Scroll_of_Detect_Thoughts_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Scroll_of_Detect_Thoughts\" title=\"Scroll of Detect Thoughts\">Scroll of Detect Thoughts</a> to their spellbooks.</li></ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>When attempting to use Detect Thoughts on an NPC, an <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Ability Check</a> is rolled. On a failure, the NPC may become hostile.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Domain\" title=\"Knowledge Domain\">Knowledge Domain</a> has a version of this spell called <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Read_Thoughts\" title=\"Read Thoughts\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Read_Thoughts_Icon.webp/20px-Read_Thoughts_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Read_Thoughts_Icon.webp/30px-Read_Thoughts_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7a/Read_Thoughts_Icon.webp/40px-Read_Thoughts_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Read Thoughts\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7a/Read_Thoughts_Icon.webp/20px-Read_Thoughts_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7a/Read_Thoughts_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Read_Thoughts\" title=\"Read Thoughts\">Read Thoughts</a> that is used by expending a <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Divinity_Charge\" title=\"Channel Divinity Charge\">Channel Divinity Charge</a> instead of the <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Spell Slot\">Spell Slot</a> and the spell is not considered a <a href=\"/wiki/Ritual\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ritual\">Ritual</a>.</li>\n<li>The incantation for Detect Thoughts is <b>Video Veritatem</b>, Latin for <i>\"I see truth\"</i>.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Despite the tooltip saying this spell uses either <a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">Intelligence</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a>, only the creature’s Intelligence is used, even if its Wisdom is higher; this is likely an oversight.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Visuals\"> Visuals </span></h2>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><div class=\"embedvideo-wrapper embedvideo--local-embed-style\" style=\"position: relative;\"><div class=\"embedvideo-localEmbedStyle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"embedvideo-overlay\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__fakeButton\">Play Video</div><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__footer\"><div class=\"embedvideo-loader__service\">Local File</div></div></div></div></div><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/4/41/Detect_Thoughts_Visuals.mp4\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 640px; height: auto;\" controls=\"\"><a href=\"https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Detect_Thoughts_Visuals.mp4\">https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Detect_Thoughts_Visuals.mp4</a></video></div></span> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Achievements\">Achievements</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; width: 100%; min-width: 10em; max-width: 45em; align-items: center; padding: 0 1em;\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"max-width: 80px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/d/d7/A-No_Penny_Required.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d7/A-No_Penny_Required.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"margin: 0 auto 0 0; padding: 0 0.8em; text-align:left;\">\n<dl><dt>No Penny Required</dt>\n<dd>Successfully use Detect Thoughts to pry into someone's thoughts.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Detect_thoughts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Detect thoughts\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Detect_thoughts\">Detect thoughts</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715034302\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.110 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.116 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 5489/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 82226/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 26149/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.040/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage